<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38959" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιβόσκ-ομαι</span></b> , of cattle, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>graze</i> or <i>feed upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεύτλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Batr.
					54
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be fed upon, eaten</i>
			<i>down</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐπιβοσκόμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					3.6.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>feed on,
				draw its nutriment</i>
			<i>from</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἶαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					68
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>devour</i>, of poison, ib.<i><span class="en">
				430
			</span></i>; of fire, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				1.14.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. metaph.,
				<i>haunt, visit</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοὶ ἐ. γῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Max.Tyr.
					19.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <i>feed
				among</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποίμνῃς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mosch.
					2.82
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
